                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1166G00                                              *        
*                                                                               
*  FUNKTION   :  CREATE INITIAL FILE WITH PACKAGING INFO TO VSIM                
*                BY PERFORMING THE FOLLOWING STEPS:                             
*                                                                               
*                PREREQUISITE: ROUTINE W116D7 TO CREATE THE TOTAL FILE          
*                 * DL1PR FOR WDK6, WDK7 AND WDB6 MUST BE DONE.                 
*                 * MUST BE RUN BEFORE RUNNING THIS JOB/ROUTINE.                
*                   (SINCE THIS EPLUS READS FILES CREATED IN W116D7)            
*                                                                               
*                STEP 1 - USING A DL1PR OF WDK6-SEGMENTS -11 AND -13,           
*                 RETREIVE THE FOLLOWING:                                       
*                   PART                                                        
*                   PLANT (I.E. IDLEVNR-EMB, HARDCODED SINCE IDDC=11)           
*                   AND                                                         
*                   ALL EMBALLAGE PART NUMBERS                                  
*                    (I.E. CLAG-IDARTNR-EMBQ0/Q1/Q2                             
*                     AND  EMB-IDARTNR-EMBX)                                    
*                 TO CREATE ONE RECORD PER PART                                 
*                 WHICH CONTAINS ALL PACKAGING PARTS.                           
*                 NOTE THAT IDLEVNR-EMB AND IDLANDX2 ARE HARDCODED              
*                 FOR CDC IN THIS STEP.                                         
*                                                                               
*                STEP 2 . USING A DL1PR OF WDK7-SEGMENTS -12 AND -26,           
*                 RETREIVE THE FOLLOWING:                                       
*                   PART                                                        
*                   IDLANDX2                                                    
*                   AND                                                         
*                   ALL EMBALLAGE PART NUMBERS                                  
*                    (I.E. LART-IDARTNR-EMBQ0/Q1/Q2                             
*                     AND  LEMB-IDARTNR-EMBX)                                   
*                 TO CREATE ONE RECORD PER PART AND COUNTRY                     
*                 WHICH CONTAINS ALL PACKAGING PARTS.                           
*                 THE RESULTING FILE IS SORTED BY IDARTNR AND IDLANDX2          
*                                                                               
*                STEP 3 - MATCH A DL1PR OF WDB6-SEGMENT -01                     
*                 WITH FILE W1166D (FROM ROUTINE W116D7, AND                    
*                 WHICH IS SORTED IN A PREVIOUS PROC-STEP BY IDDC               
*                 AND DC 11 HAS BEEN OMITTED) TO                                
*                 RETREIVE THE FOLLOWING:                                       
*                   FROM W1166D:                                                
*                     PART                                                      
*                     IDDC                                                      
*                   FROM WDB601:                                                
*                     IDLANDX2                                                  
*                     IDLEVNR-EMB (A.K.A. "PARTNER", "PLANT")                   
*                                                                               
*                STEP 4 - SORT FILE FROM STEP 3 BY IDARTNR AND IDLANDX2         
*                                                                               
*                STEP 5 - MATCH FILES FROM STEP 2 AND STEP 4                    
*                 TO CREATE FILE ON PART AND COUNTRY/"MARKET" LEVEL.            
*                 THAT IS, 1 OUTPUT-RECORD WILL BE WRITTEN FOR                  
*                 EACH PART-COUNTRY COMBINATION. EACH RECORD CAN HOLD           
*                 UP TO 5 CONCERNED NDCS FOR THAT PART-COUNTRY COMBO.           
*                                                                               
*                FOLLOWING STEPS (AFTER THIS PGM):                              
*                 THE FILES FROM STEP 1 AND STEP 5 WILL BE                      
*                 COMBINED AND SORTED                                           
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*  FÖRFATTARE :  CHESTER COUCH                                         *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166GD1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W1166GK6 'K611-'                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166GD2                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W1166GK6 'K613-'                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166GD3 FB(153 0)                                                         
*                                                                               
%W1166G  'OUTK6-'                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166GD4                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W1166GK7 'K712-'                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166GD5                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W1166GK7 'K726-'                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166GDF FB(128 0)                                                         
*                                                                               
%W1166GA 'TMPK7-'                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166GD6 FB(128 0)                                                         
*                                                                               
%W1166GA 'TMPK7B-'                                                              
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166GD7                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W1166GB6 'B601-'                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166GD8                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W1166D   'IN6D-'                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166GD9 FB(18 0)                                                          
*                                                                               
%W1166GB 'OUTXREF-'                                                             
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W1166GDA FB(153 0)                                                         
*                                                                               
%W1166G  'OUTK7-'                                                               
                                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
SW-PACKAGING-EXISTS          W  1  A                                            
YES                          W  1  A VALUE 'Y'                                  
NO                           W  1  A VALUE 'N'                                  
W-KDEMBKEY                   W  3  A                                            
W-KDEMBKEY-TYPE   W-KDEMBKEY    1  A                                            
W-KDEMBKEY-IX     W-KDEMBKEY +1 2  N                                            
                                                                                
W-OUTK7-IX                   W  1  N                                            
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* STEP 1. MATCH K611 AND ALL K613 SEGMENTS TO CREATE ONE RECORD                 
*         WITH ALL PACKAGING PARTS PER PART                                     
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W1166GD1 KEY(K611-IDARTNR   )  +                                     
           W1166GD2 KEY(K613-IDARTNR   )  +                                     
          )                                                                     
                                                                                
   IF W1166GD1                                                                  
      IF FIRST-DUP     W1166GD2           +                                     
      OR NOT DUPLICATE W1166GD2           +                                     
      OR NOT MATCHED                                                            
         SW-PACKAGING-EXISTS    = NO                                            
         OUTK6-IDARTNR         = K611-IDARTNR                                   
         OUTK6-IDLANDX2        = 'SE'                                           
         OUTK6-IDLEVNR-EMB(1)  = 'BP2TW'                                        
         OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBQ0   = K611-IDARTNR-EMBQ0                             
         OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBQ1   = K611-IDARTNR-EMBQ1                             
         OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBQ2   = K611-IDARTNR-EMBQ2                             
         IF K611-IDARTNR-EMBQ0 > 0                   +                          
         OR K611-IDARTNR-EMBQ1 > 0                   +                          
         OR K611-IDARTNR-EMBQ2 > 0                                              
            SW-PACKAGING-EXISTS  = YES                                          
         END-IF                                                                 
                                                                                
         OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBIX   = 1                                              
         DO WHILE OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBIX < 11                                      
            OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMB(OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBIX) = 0                          
            OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBIX = OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBIX + 1                       
         END-DO                                                                 
         OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBIX   = 1                                              
      ELSE                                                                      
         IF MATCHED                                                             
            OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBIX   = OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBIX + 1                     
         END-IF                                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
                                                                                
      IF MATCHED                                                                
         W-KDEMBKEY            = K613-KDEMBKEY                                  
         IF  OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBIX < 11                 +                         
         AND W-KDEMBKEY-IX     >=  1                  +                         
         AND W-KDEMBKEY-IX     <= 10                                            
            OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMB(W-KDEMBKEY-IX)          +                         
               = K613-IDARTNR-EMB                                               
            IF K613-IDARTNR-EMB   > 0                                           
               SW-PACKAGING-EXISTS  = YES                                       
            END-IF                                                              
         END-IF                                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
                                                                                
      IF LAST-DUP      W1166GD2                +                                
      OR NOT DUPLICATE W1166GD2                +                                
      OR NOT MATCHED                                                            
         IF SW-PACKAGING-EXISTS  = YES                                          
            PUT W1166GD3                                                        
         END-IF                                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* STEP 2. MATCH K712 AND ALL K726 SEGMENTS TO CREATE ONE RECORD                 
*         WITH ALL PACKAGING PARTS PER PART                                     
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W1166GD4 KEY(K712-IDARTNR, K712-IDLANDX2       )  +                  
           W1166GD5 KEY(K726-IDARTNR, K726-IDLANDX2-K726  )  +                  
          )                                                                     
                                                                                
   IF W1166GD4                                                                  
      IF FIRST-DUP     W1166GD5           +                                     
      OR NOT DUPLICATE W1166GD5           +                                     
      OR NOT MATCHED                                                            
         SW-PACKAGING-EXISTS    = NO                                            
         TMPK7-IDARTNR         = K712-IDARTNR                                   
         TMPK7-IDLANDX2        = K712-IDLANDX2                                  
         TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBQ0   = K712-IDARTNR-EMBQ0                             
         TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBQ1   = K712-IDARTNR-EMBQ1                             
         TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBQ2   = K712-IDARTNR-EMBQ2                             
         IF K712-IDARTNR-EMBQ0 > 0                   +                          
         OR K712-IDARTNR-EMBQ1 > 0                   +                          
         OR K712-IDARTNR-EMBQ2 > 0                                              
            SW-PACKAGING-EXISTS  = YES                                          
         END-IF                                                                 
                                                                                
         TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBIX   = 1                                              
         DO WHILE TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBIX < 11                                      
            TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMB(TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBIX) = 0                          
            TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBIX = TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBIX + 1                       
         END-DO                                                                 
         TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBIX   = 1                                              
      ELSE                                                                      
         IF MATCHED                                                             
            TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBIX   = TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBIX + 1                     
         END-IF                                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
                                                                                
      IF MATCHED                                                                
         W-KDEMBKEY            = K726-KDEMBKEY                                  
         IF  TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBIX < 11                 +                         
         AND W-KDEMBKEY-IX     >=  1                  +                         
         AND W-KDEMBKEY-IX     <= 10                                            
            TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMB(W-KDEMBKEY-IX)          +                         
               = K726-IDARTNR-EMB                                               
            IF K726-IDARTNR-EMB   > 0                                           
               SW-PACKAGING-EXISTS  = YES                                       
            END-IF                                                              
         END-IF                                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
                                                                                
      IF LAST-DUP      W1166GD5                +                                
      OR NOT DUPLICATE W1166GD5                +                                
      OR NOT MATCHED                                                            
         IF SW-PACKAGING-EXISTS  = YES                                          
            PUT W1166GDF                                                        
         END-IF                                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* STEP 2B MATCH W1166GD3 WITH W1166GD6 TO ADD                                   
*         EMBQ0/1/2 TO TMPK7 IF THEY ARE NOT ALREADY SET                        
JOB INPUT (W1166GD3 KEY(OUTK6-IDARTNR  ) +                                      
           W1166GDF KEY(TMPK7-IDARTNR ) +                                       
          )                                                                     
                                                                                
   IF W1166GDF                                                                  
      TMPK7B-W1166GA-CTX       = TMPK7-W1166GA-CTX                              
      IF  MATCHED                         +                                     
      AND (  TMPK7-IDLANDX2 = 'CN'        +                                     
          OR TMPK7-IDLANDX2 = 'US'   )                                          
         IF  TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBQ0 = 0                                            
            TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBQ0 = OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBQ0                          
         END-IF                                                                 
         IF  TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBQ1 = 0                                            
            TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBQ1 = OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBQ1                          
         END-IF                                                                 
         IF  TMPK7-IDARTNR-EMBQ2 = 0                                            
            TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBQ2 = OUTK6-IDARTNR-EMBQ2                          
         END-IF                                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
      PUT W1166GD6                                                              
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* STEP 3. MATCH A DL1PR OF WDB6-SEGMENT -01 WITH                                
*         FILE W1166D TO GET IDLANDX2 AND IDLEVNR-EMB FOR                       
*         EACH PART - IDDC COMBINATION                                          
JOB INPUT (W1166GD7 KEY(B601-IDDC   )  +                                        
           W1166GD8 KEY(IN6D-IDDC   )  +                                        
          )                                                                     
                                                                                
   IF MATCHED                                                                   
      OUTXREF-IDARTNR         = IN6D-IDARTNR                                    
      OUTXREF-IDDC            = IN6D-IDDC                                       
      OUTXREF-IDLANDX2        = B601-IDLANDX2                                   
      OUTXREF-IDLEVNR-EMB     = B601-IDLEVNR-EMB                                
      PUT W1166GD9                                                              
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* STEP 4. SORT FILE FROM PREVIOUS STEP                                          
*                                                                               
  SORT W1166GD9 TO +                                                            
       W1166GD9 USING (OUTXREF-IDARTNR, OUTXREF-IDLANDX2)                       
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* STEP 5. MATCH FILE WITH K7-PACK-INFO WITH                                     
*         THE PART-IDDC-IDLANDX2-IDLEVNR-EMB CROSSREF FILE                      
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W1166GD6 KEY(TMPK7B-IDARTNR , TMPK7B-IDLANDX2    )  +                
           W1166GD9 KEY(OUTXREF-IDARTNR, OUTXREF-IDLANDX2   )  +                
          )                                                                     
                                                                                
   IF MATCHED                                                                   
      IF FIRST-DUP W1166GD9                                +                    
      OR NOT DUPLICATE W1166GD9                                                 
         OUTK7-IDARTNR        = TMPK7B-IDARTNR                                  
         OUTK7-IDLANDX2       = TMPK7B-IDLANDX2                                 
         OUTK7-IDARTNR-EMBQ0  = TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBQ0                            
         OUTK7-IDARTNR-EMBQ1  = TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBQ1                            
         OUTK7-IDARTNR-EMBQ2  = TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBQ2                            
         TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBIX = 1                                               
         DO WHILE TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBIX < 11                                     
            OUTK7-IDARTNR-EMBIX = TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBIX                          
                                                                                
            OUTK7-IDARTNR-EMB(OUTK7-IDARTNR-EMBIX) =       +                    
               TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMB(TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBIX)                         
                                                                                
            TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBIX = TMPK7B-IDARTNR-EMBIX + 1                     
         END-DO                                                                 
                                                                                
         W-OUTK7-IX           = 1                                               
         DO WHILE W-OUTK7-IX  < 6                                               
            OUTK7-IDLEVNR-EMB(W-OUTK7-IX) = '     '                             
            W-OUTK7-IX        = W-OUTK7-IX + 1                                  
         END-DO                                                                 
         W-OUTK7-IX           = 1                                               
      ELSE                                                                      
         W-OUTK7-IX           = W-OUTK7-IX + 1                                  
      END-IF                                                                    
                                                                                
      OUTK7-IDLEVNR-EMB(W-OUTK7-IX) = OUTXREF-IDLEVNR-EMB                       
                                                                                
      IF LAST-DUP W1166GD9                                +                     
      OR NOT DUPLICATE W1166GD9                                                 
         PUT W1166GDA                                                           
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
